#: admin/class-custom-permalinks-about.php:126
msgid "Allows you apply HTTP Auth on your site. You can apply Http Authentication all over the site or only the admin pages. It helps to stop crawling on your site while on development or persist the Brute Attacks by locking the Admin Pages."
msgstr "Allows you apply HTTP Auth on your site. You can apply Http Authentication all over the site or only the admin pages. It helps to stop crawling on your site while on development or persist the Brute Attacks by locking the Admin Pages."

#: admin/class-custom-permalinks-about.php:105
msgid "Secure your site from the XSS Attacks so, your users won't lose any kind of information or not redirected to any other site by visiting your site with the malicious code in the URL or so. In this way, users can open their site URLs without any hesitation."
msgstr "Secure your site from the XSS Attacks so, your users won't lose any kind of information or not redirected to any other site by visiting your site with the malicious code in the URL or so. In this way, users can open their site URLs without any hesitation."

#: admin/class-custom-permalinks-about.php:231
msgid "Simply the easiest solution to add valid schema.org as a JSON script in the head of posts and pages. It provides you multiple SCHEMA types like Article, News Article, Organization and Website Schema."
msgstr "Simply the easiest solution to add valid schema.org as a JSON script in the head of posts and pages. It provides you multiple SCHEMA types like Article, News Article, Organisation and Website Schema."

